.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
node_modules/
*.log
.netlify/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.claude/settings.local.json

# Combat logs are the collaborator's own play records and can contain private
# chat. logstats.py reads them from outside the repo; only the derived counts
# in assets/measured.json are committed.
state/logs/
*eqlog*.txt

# Inventory dumps are a named character's holdings. They carry no chat, but they
# are still a person's account contents and nobody asked for them to be public.
# inventory.py commits only the impersonal half: item name to numeric ID.
state/inventory/
*-Inventory.txt
